### What I learned

I learned how to structure an html properly using semantics html, and i also learned how to use external font styles via impoerting.

```css
.proud-of-this-css {
  :root{
    --navy-950: hsl(233, 47%, 7%);
    --blue-950: hsl(244, 37%, 16%);
    --purple-500: hsl(277, 64%, 61%);
    --main-heading: hsl(0, 0%, 100%);
    --w-paragraph: hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.75);
    --stat-headings: hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.6);
}
}
```

